{"id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-oracle-numbering.md","title":"相对部分函数与有限 oracle","display":"df-oracle-numbering — 相对部分函数与有限 oracle","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-oracle-numbering","aliases":["20-df-oracle-numbering"],"display":"df-oracle-numbering — 相对部分函数与有限 oracle","chapter":"3","section":"3.2","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"§3.2；Notation: Partial A-Computable Functions","source_pdf_pages":[89,90],"source_printed_pages":[53,54],"depends_on":["[[20-df-oracle-machine]]","[[20-df-numbering]]","[[20-df-strings]]","[[20-df-computable]]","[[20-df-tmcomp]]","[[20-df-characteristic]]","[[20-df-pairing]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-oracle-numbering"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-oracle-numbering</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-oracle-numbering — 相对部分函数与有限 oracle"},{"key":"chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"section","html":"3.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"§3.2；Notation: Partial A-Computable Functions"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89</span><span>90</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>53</span><span>54</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2af550cdf8ea0be2\" href=\"?note=2af550cdf8ea0be2\" title=\"20-df-oracle-machine\">20-df-oracle-machine</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"04aa1148d91b88f8\" href=\"?note=04aa1148d91b88f8\" title=\"20-df-tmcomp\">20-df-tmcomp</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"de14d8d6c42250de\" href=\"?note=de14d8d6c42250de\" title=\"20-df-characteristic\">20-df-characteristic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,x,y,k\\in\\omega\">\\(e,x,y,k\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\">\\(\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,\\eta\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\sigma,\\eta\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。固定原有有效 oracle 程序编号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\mapsto M_e\">\\(e\\mapsto M_e\\)</span>，其编码、译码算法作为同一环境参数保留；每个有限 oracle 程序至少有一个代码，不重新排列索引。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_e=(M_e^\\circ,Q_{e,q},b_{e,0},b_{e,1})\">\\(M_e=(M_e^\\circ,Q_{e,q},b_{e,0},b_{e,1})\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 是其普通程序使用的共同二符号磁带字母表。</p>\n<p>历史 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 是有限配置序列；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c(i)=(q_i,t_i,h_i)\">\\(c(i)=(q_i,t_i,h_i)\\)</span> 仅表示该历史在 i 处的坐标。自然数输入和有限串输入的元组记号按上游原约定解释。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2af550cdf8ea0be2\" href=\"?note=2af550cdf8ea0be2\" title=\"20-df-oracle-machine\">20-df-oracle-machine</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"04aa1148d91b88f8\" href=\"?note=04aa1148d91b88f8\" title=\"20-df-tmcomp\">20-df-tmcomp</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"de14d8d6c42250de\" href=\"?note=de14d8d6c42250de\" title=\"20-df-characteristic\">20-df-characteristic</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Hist}_k(e,A,\\vec x,y,c)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\ \\exists\\gamma\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_{M_e}^{n+1}\\\n\\exists t\\in\\operatorname{Tape}_S\\ \\exists h\\in\\mathbb Z\\\n[c=\\gamma\\land\\gamma(0)=c_0^{(k)}(\\vec x)\\\\\n\\land(\\forall i&lt;n\\ [\\gamma(i)\\to_{M_e}^A\\gamma(i+1)])\n\\land\\gamma(n)=(0,t,h)\\land y=|\\{z\\in\\mathbb Z:t(z)=1\\}|],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Hist}(e,A,x,y,c)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{Hist}_1(e,A,(x),y,c),\\\\\n\\Phi_e^{A,(k)}:=\\{(\\vec x,y)\\in\\omega^k\\times\\omega:\n\\exists c\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_{M_e}^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\operatorname{Hist}_k(e,A,\\vec x,y,c)\\},\\\\\n\\Phi_e^{A,(k)}(\\vec x)\\downarrow=y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists c\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_{M_e}^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\operatorname{Hist}_k(e,A,\\vec x,y,c),\\\\\n\\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow=y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists c\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_{M_e}^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\operatorname{Hist}(e,A,x,y,c),\\qquad\n\\Phi_e^A(\\vec x)\\simeq\\Phi_e^{A,(k)}(\\vec x),\\\\\nA_\\sigma:=\\{i&lt;|\\sigma|:\\sigma(i)=1\\},\\\\\n\\Phi_e^\\sigma(x)\\downarrow=y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists c\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_{M_e}^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\Bigl[\\operatorname{Hist}(e,A_\\sigma,x,y,c)\\land\n\\forall i&lt;|c|\\ \\forall q\\in Q_{e,q}\\ \\forall t\\in\\operatorname{Tape}_S\\ \\forall h\\in\\mathbb Z\\\\\n\\bigl(c(i)=(q,t,h)\\Rightarrow\\exists n&lt;|\\sigma|\\ [\\operatorname{num}(t,h)\\downarrow=n]\\bigr)\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathcal C_k^A:=\\{f:\\omega^k\\rightharpoonup\\omega:\n\\exists e\\in\\omega\\ \\forall\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\\n[f(\\vec x)\\simeq\\Phi_e^{A,(k)}(\\vec x)]\\},\\\\\n(\\mathcal C_k^A)^{\\mathrm{tot}}:=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k^A:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Hist}_k(e,A,\\vec x,y,c)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\ \\exists\\gamma\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_{M_e}^{n+1}\\\n\\exists t\\in\\operatorname{Tape}_S\\ \\exists h\\in\\mathbb Z\\\n[c=\\gamma\\land\\gamma(0)=c_0^{(k)}(\\vec x)\\\\\n\\land(\\forall i&lt;n\\ [\\gamma(i)\\to_{M_e}^A\\gamma(i+1)])\n\\land\\gamma(n)=(0,t,h)\\land y=|\\{z\\in\\mathbb Z:t(z)=1\\}|],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Hist}(e,A,x,y,c)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{Hist}_1(e,A,(x),y,c),\\\\\n\\Phi_e^{A,(k)}:=\\{(\\vec x,y)\\in\\omega^k\\times\\omega:\n\\exists c\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_{M_e}^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\operatorname{Hist}_k(e,A,\\vec x,y,c)\\},\\\\\n\\Phi_e^{A,(k)}(\\vec x)\\downarrow=y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists c\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_{M_e}^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\operatorname{Hist}_k(e,A,\\vec x,y,c),\\\\\n\\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow=y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists c\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_{M_e}^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\operatorname{Hist}(e,A,x,y,c),\\qquad\n\\Phi_e^A(\\vec x)\\simeq\\Phi_e^{A,(k)}(\\vec x),\\\\\nA_\\sigma:=\\{i&lt;|\\sigma|:\\sigma(i)=1\\},\\\\\n\\Phi_e^\\sigma(x)\\downarrow=y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists c\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_{M_e}^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\Bigl[\\operatorname{Hist}(e,A_\\sigma,x,y,c)\\land\n\\forall i&lt;|c|\\ \\forall q\\in Q_{e,q}\\ \\forall t\\in\\operatorname{Tape}_S\\ \\forall h\\in\\mathbb Z\\\\\n\\bigl(c(i)=(q,t,h)\\Rightarrow\\exists n&lt;|\\sigma|\\ [\\operatorname{num}(t,h)\\downarrow=n]\\bigr)\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathcal C_k^A:=\\{f:\\omega^k\\rightharpoonup\\omega:\n\\exists e\\in\\omega\\ \\forall\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\\n[f(\\vec x)\\simeq\\Phi_e^{A,(k)}(\\vec x)]\\},\\\\\n(\\mathcal C_k^A)^{\\mathrm{tot}}:=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k^A:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\Phi_e^X(x)\\simeq\\Phi_e^{\\operatorname{set}(X)}(x)\\quad(X\\in2^\\omega),\\\\\n\\Phi_e^f(x)\\simeq\\Phi_e^{\\{\\langle n,f(n)\\rangle:n\\in\\omega\\}}(x)\n\\quad(f\\in\\omega^\\omega\\setminus2^\\omega),\\\\\n\\Phi_e^\\sigma\\succeq\\eta\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall n&lt;|\\eta|\\ [\\Phi_e^\\sigma(n)\\downarrow=\\eta(n)].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\Phi_e^X(x)\\simeq\\Phi_e^{\\operatorname{set}(X)}(x)\\quad(X\\in2^\\omega),\\\\\n\\Phi_e^f(x)\\simeq\\Phi_e^{\\{\\langle n,f(n)\\rangle:n\\in\\omega\\}}(x)\n\\quad(f\\in\\omega^\\omega\\setminus2^\\omega),\\\\\n\\Phi_e^\\sigma\\succeq\\eta\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall n&lt;|\\eta|\\ [\\Phi_e^\\sigma(n)\\downarrow=\\eta(n)].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>一元 Hist 现在明确是同一多元历史关系的 k=1 实例，避免两套输入或输出规则漂移。有限 oracle 的每次查询都必须有译码值且严格小于串长；没有把未给定位一概当作可访问的 0。</p>\n<p>二进制实仍使用位集合 oracle，其他全自然数函数仍使用配对编码的函数图 oracle。固定的普通编号、oracle 编号、输入编码及正常停止输出计数均未更换。</p>\n<p>来源：§3.2；Notation: Partial A-Computable Functions；印刷页 53, 54；PDF 第 89, 90 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-oracle-machine","status":"resolved","id":"2af550cdf8ea0be2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-oracle-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-strings]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tmcomp","status":"resolved","id":"04aa1148d91b88f8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-tmcomp]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-characteristic","status":"resolved","id":"de14d8d6c42250de","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-characteristic]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-pairing]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-machine","status":"resolved","id":"2af550cdf8ea0be2","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-machine]]；see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-tmcomp]]；see [[20-df-characteristic]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-machine]]；see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-tmcomp]]；see [[20-df-characteristic]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-machine]]；see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-tmcomp]]；see [[20-df-characteristic]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-machine]]；see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-tmcomp]]；see [[20-df-characteristic]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tmcomp","status":"resolved","id":"04aa1148d91b88f8","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-machine]]；see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-tmcomp]]；see [[20-df-characteristic]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-characteristic","status":"resolved","id":"de14d8d6c42250de","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-machine]]；see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-tmcomp]]；see [[20-df-characteristic]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-14","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-machine]]；see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-tmcomp]]；see [[20-df-characteristic]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"e,x,y,k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x\\in\\omega^k","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma,\\eta\\in2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"e\\mapsto M_e","display":false},{"tex":"M_e=(M_e^\\circ,Q_{e,q},b_{e,0},b_{e,1})","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"c(i)=(q_i,t_i,h_i)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Hist}_k(e,A,\\vec x,y,c)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\ \\exists\\gamma\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_{M_e}^{n+1}\\\n\\exists t\\in\\operatorname{Tape}_S\\ \\exists h\\in\\mathbb Z\\\n[c=\\gamma\\land\\gamma(0)=c_0^{(k)}(\\vec x)\\\\\n\\land(\\forall i<n\\ [\\gamma(i)\\to_{M_e}^A\\gamma(i+1)])\n\\land\\gamma(n)=(0,t,h)\\land y=|\\{z\\in\\mathbb Z:t(z)=1\\}|],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Hist}(e,A,x,y,c)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{Hist}_1(e,A,(x),y,c),\\\\\n\\Phi_e^{A,(k)}:=\\{(\\vec x,y)\\in\\omega^k\\times\\omega:\n\\exists c\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_{M_e}^{<\\omega}\\ \\operatorname{Hist}_k(e,A,\\vec x,y,c)\\},\\\\\n\\Phi_e^{A,(k)}(\\vec x)\\downarrow=y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists c\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_{M_e}^{<\\omega}\\ \\operatorname{Hist}_k(e,A,\\vec x,y,c),\\\\\n\\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow=y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists c\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_{M_e}^{<\\omega}\\ \\operatorname{Hist}(e,A,x,y,c),\\qquad\n\\Phi_e^A(\\vec x)\\simeq\\Phi_e^{A,(k)}(\\vec x),\\\\\nA_\\sigma:=\\{i<|\\sigma|:\\sigma(i)=1\\},\\\\\n\\Phi_e^\\sigma(x)\\downarrow=y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists c\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_{M_e}^{<\\omega}\\ \\Bigl[\\operatorname{Hist}(e,A_\\sigma,x,y,c)\\land\n\\forall i<|c|\\ \\forall q\\in Q_{e,q}\\ \\forall t\\in\\operatorname{Tape}_S\\ \\forall h\\in\\mathbb Z\\\\\n\\bigl(c(i)=(q,t,h)\\Rightarrow\\exists n<|\\sigma|\\ [\\operatorname{num}(t,h)\\downarrow=n]\\bigr)\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathcal C_k^A:=\\{f:\\omega^k\\rightharpoonup\\omega:\n\\exists e\\in\\omega\\ \\forall\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\\n[f(\\vec x)\\simeq\\Phi_e^{A,(k)}(\\vec x)]\\},\\\\\n(\\mathcal C_k^A)^{\\mathrm{tot}}:=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k^A:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\Phi_e^X(x)\\simeq\\Phi_e^{\\operatorname{set}(X)}(x)\\quad(X\\in2^\\omega),\\\\\n\\Phi_e^f(x)\\simeq\\Phi_e^{\\{\\langle n,f(n)\\rangle:n\\in\\omega\\}}(x)\n\\quad(f\\in\\omega^\\omega\\setminus2^\\omega),\\\\\n\\Phi_e^\\sigma\\succeq\\eta\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall n<|\\eta|\\ [\\Phi_e^\\sigma(n)\\downarrow=\\eta(n)].\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":4042,"backlinks":[{"id":"4a668d5b21b39c67","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]。"},{"id":"d92408f78f418e97","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]。"},{"id":"5c8fcd5a2bc3a582","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-function-tree]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]。"},{"id":"634b02102672cc2a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。"},{"id":"7e2e8a3b26e3283a","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-deg]]；see [[20-df-domination]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]。"},{"id":"60962a9176d0987e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]。"},{"id":"e890b3c29e4a70a3","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"cou